Scope note

This MIT-0 license covers the contents of this directory only: SKILL.md,
references/, and assets/. It is an agent skill package consisting of
instructions, documentation, and JSON templates.

The `owlrunkit` command-line tool that this skill invokes is a separate and
independent work, distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. This skill package
contains no portion of that tool's source code and invokes it only as an
external process over the command line. The GPL-3.0-or-later license of
`owlrunkit` therefore does not extend to this skill package.

The LICENSE file at the root of the repository that hosts this directory
governs the repository as a whole and does not override the MIT-0 grant
above for this directory.
